{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「以法蓮以風為食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"整天追逐東風，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虛謊和暴力日益增多；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他跟亞述結盟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向埃及進貢橄欖油。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和華指控猶大；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂要按雅各所行的懲罰他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"照雅各所做的報應他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各在母胎之中曾抓住哥哥的腳跟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"壯年之時曾跟上帝角力。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他跟天使角力得勝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向天使哭求福分。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他在伯特利遇見祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那裡與祂說話，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂就是萬軍之上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華是祂的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，你們要歸向你們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"持守仁愛和公義，常常等候祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"以法蓮是個奸商，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"手裡拿著騙人的秤，喜歡壓榨人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮說：「我發財了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我依靠自己致富。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有人能從我的勞碌中找出過錯和罪惡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「從你們出埃及以來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就是你們的上帝耶和華。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使你們再次住在帳篷裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像從前守節期時一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾對先知講話，賜給他們許多異象，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藉他們用比喻警告你們。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"基列人充滿罪惡，終必滅亡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在吉甲用公牛獻祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的祭壇像田間犁溝裡的石堆。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各曾逃往亞蘭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列在那裡為娶妻而服侍人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為得到妻子而替人牧羊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華藉著先知帶領以色列離開埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也藉著先知保護他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但以法蓮卻極大地觸怒耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以他的主要讓他血債血還，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以羞辱還羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}